sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant N as Next.js App
    participant A as NextAuth
    participant O as OAuth Provider (GitHub/Google)
    participant DB as MongoDB

    U->>N: Signs up with email/password
    N->>A: Handles signup
    A->>DB: Check if user exists

    alt User does not exist
        DB-->>A: Not found
        A->>DB: Create new user
        A->>DB: Create account (credentials)
    else User exists
        DB-->>A: Return existing user
        A->>A: Verify password
    end

    A-->>N: Return session
    N-->>U: Complete signup/login

    Note over U,N: Later...

    U->>N: Initiates social login
    N->>A: Redirect to NextAuth
    A->>O: Redirect to OAuth provider

    O-->>U: Prompt login
    U->>O: Provide credentials

    O-->>A: Return OAuth token
    A->>DB: Check existing user (email)

    alt User exists
        DB-->>A: Return existing user
    else New OAuth user
        A->>DB: Create new account (OAuth)
    end

    A->>DB: Update user profile (name, image)
    DB-->>A: Confirm update

    A->>A: Generate updated session
    A-->>N: Return updated session
    N-->>U: Complete login with updated info